  "body": "Tucked away in a peaceful and private setting, this beautifully presented home offers stunning views, thoughtfully designed living spaces and a wonderful sense of serenity, all within easy reach of the marina and local amenities.\r\n\r\nDesigned for comfortable, relaxed living, the contemporary kitchen and open-plan dining and living areas connect effortlessly with the outdoors. Enjoy your morning coffee in the private, landscaped garden, or unwind on the deck with beautiful views and evening sunsets.\r\n\r\nThe home has been extensively improved over the years, with quality finishes and attention to detail throughout. Double glazing, central heating, beautiful timber flooring and well-appointed bathrooms provide comfort and practicality in every season.\r\n\r\nThe thoughtful layout provides flexibility for a range of lifestyles. Upstairs, two bedrooms, including the master, are complemented by a study and family bathroom, while the light-filled living spaces form the heart of the home.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, an additional bedroom and second bathroom provide excellent separation for family members or guests, while a generous storage room offers valuable extra space. An internal-access garage incorporating the laundry adds everyday convenience.\r\n\r\nAnd while it feels wonderfully peaceful and private, everything you need is close at hand. Enjoy the cafés, restaurants and supermarket at Half Moon Bay Marina, with the added convenience of nearby local amenities. Families will also appreciate the sought-after school zoning for Macleans College, Bucklands Beach Intermediate and Pigeon Mountain Primary.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking to downsize without compromise, an Auckland lock up and leave, accommodate family or simply enjoy a quieter pace of life, this inviting home combines privacy, comfort and flexibility in a highly desirable location.",
